#: scenario7:scenario7_115FC035_3AAB_4941_9F70_A7FDD8BA7472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed138e256d9c86d778c31503a7c68cef6f6d19b5a45e19a9300e72cbe2ff41bc
#. default-sha256: 1c05a4b314343339c433f88b2647c3004d8d4c0cdfa04a287f1f89e355331139
